[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: The item kind is recomputed by the board, not stored on the relation

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @repo

[WORK]
UID: WORK-KIND-NOT-IN-RELATION
TITLE: The item kind is recomputed by the board, not stored on the relation
DEPTH: sketch
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
The extractor reports a KIND for each source item, and the adapter emits it,
but the File relation written by `scribe relate` stores only ELEMENT, ID and
LINE_RANGE. The board therefore recomputes the kind from the id when it draws
the card, so the displayed kind can disagree with what the extractor actually
saw. Cheapest fix: carry KIND on the File relation and have the board read it
instead of guessing.
<<<
